### Design Rationale Summary

| Milestone | Rule Type | Why This Rule |
|-----------|-----------|---------------|
| `find_cow` | `position_near_with_facing` | Preferred rule for find/locate tasks per guidelines. Correctly models "player can see the cow" by checking both proximity and facing direction. NoAI cow guarantees target stays at known coordinates. |
| `sell_leather` | `inventory_has` | Preferred rule for sell/trade tasks. The emerald is the direct outcome of the trade and doesn't exist in the scene otherwise — zero false positive risk. More reliable than position-based checks since it verifies the actual trade completion. |

Both milestones have been verified through 3 rounds of sandbox testing. The scene is compact (~10 blocks), all entities are correctly positioned, and the tasks are achievable in sequence.

